us/parser/ParserTest.java\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"0c69a40121bbac159640e938f4004565d79b8134","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Ignore extra arguments for the help command","messageBody":"Allow inputs such as help 123 to display usage, matching\nthe argument handling of other commands without parameters.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"232c5aa4da1e524f642204315c17a0845fe60178","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Current Junit Tests ignored arguments for help and exit","messageBody":"Cover extra arguments, case variations, and whitespace to\ntest the behaviour of commands without parameters.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":10,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"cd61e2fba9296d8ac445bfdf2dad597b5fcf48a2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add new commands to help and the User Guide","messageBody":"List recent, opening, delete, and rate in the help table and\nverify its output. Document all commands in the User Guide so\nthe written instructions match the available commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":4,"deletions":0},"docs":{"insertions":45,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":4,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"fda25d32bccc19f91209d807e177b32d870323ae","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch-HelpCommand into master branch","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"4203b40b638e3217c5985302830e6a66e579fd82","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #20 from nkyjStar/view-balance","messageBody":"View balance","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"9fcdcda86cb98d33ac35dcb08eee26208abd0a9b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027AY2627S1-CS2113-W13-2:master\u0027 into master","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c037c4751a439df9bd768dbdbd8144585dad30bc","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into branch-HelpCommand","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"947bdd1c6410fd2eb5a5a04feedd1fc2cd9706ce","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add balance command to help table","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"1dbed4271f9e1cb1ea592b5f5ec1d7836c51e3e9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Test balance command in help output","messageBody":"Add the balance row to the expected help output so the complete table\nremains covered by the command test.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"cbb67edcde15bf8f98050f122a81005ea7195438","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #17 from naieel04/branch-HelpCommand","messageBody":"Add help command and unit tests","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"nabijonzzz":[{"date":"2026-09-30T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e97430e5cd76f3f0a131a9d5cd6826473dbd9d43","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Nabijon to AboutUs","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-07T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"93130993530cce9e77388cc7df1978966ee82359","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add deposit and withdraw commands with core structure","messageBody":"Implement deposit (#8) and withdraw (#9). These are the first features that create transactions, so add the shared base they need: Transaction, TransactionList, Command, Parser, Ui and FinNusException. Other commands (balance, recent, delete, help) can be added as new Command subclasses. Parser accepts parameters in any order, rejects invalid amounts (negative, zero, more than 2 decimals, NaN, scientific notation) and requires a description for withdraw. Add JUnit tests for parsing, commands and Transaction formatting.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":416,"deletions":11},"test-code":{"insertions":172,"deletions":12}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-09T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"8dd358993af96157db0ee932df21319daa5e7b3d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use BigDecimal for amounts and add no-description deposit constructor","messageBody":"double cannot represent most decimal values exactly (e.g. 0.1 + 0.2 \u003d 0.30000000000000004), so balances would drift and comparisons could be wrong. BigDecimal keeps amounts exact. Add DepositCommand(BigDecimal) for deposits without a description, as suggested in review. Enable assertions for the Gradle run task.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":39,"deletions":18},"other":{"insertions":2,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":37,"deletions":12}}},{"hash":"c1925a79cec3390ec12e1f93d37b9e55b9019f15","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add deposit and withdraw sections to User Guide","messageBody":"Document the format, amount rules (positive, at most 2 decimal places, max 1,000,000), optional vs required description, and that parameters can be given in any order. Include examples and expected output so users know what to expect. Replace the template todo example.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":57,"deletions":14}}}]}],"chancheese":[{"date":"2026-09-30T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"b7b6780967ec5a849fc42ece7762fc6f2923eac9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add my own About Us","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"59962eb92fb46d567e2d39c867ef13c58f55f218","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into chancheese-AboutUs","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"8f39b1fe8af8c9f175762e594105598956972bb6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #4 from chancheese/chancheese-AboutUs","messageBody":"Add my own About Us","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-13T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"975b9d01feff9a78ca6a11cb22edf394d7592e31","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #21 from lololol